  "sourceTitle": "Evaluate skill-equipped agents with Strands Evals and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore",
  "sourceBodyHash": "9c0fd792f9c8fe64792c8c662d96198a7e1a6ae17861fcb6e3d4af992b925dea",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-26T09:55:33.954702Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-29T04:47:35.391642Z",
  "totalBlocks": 87,
  "translatedBlocks": 48,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99ff41f68c0983fd",
      "translationZh": "通用型智能体可以处理广泛的任务，但你仍然需要它们遵循运行业务的流程：合规性检查、文档处理工作流、升级策略、工程规范。将所有这些内容编码在单个系统提示词或应用逻辑中会变得难以维护和更新。技能（Skills）是一种模块化的替代方案。技能是一组可重用的指令集，通常存储在 SKILL.md 文件中，用于教导智能体执行特定领域的任务，例如脱敏合同、核对发票或遵循团队的拉取请求（pull-request）规范。由于技能遵循开放的 Agent Skills 标准，它们可以在兼容的框架之间移植，且智能体在运行时仅加载所需的技能，而不是在其核心指令中携带所有流程。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62512289b0b6089c",
      "translationZh": "技能将一个或多个工具与智能体正确使用它们所需的上下文封装在一起：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60ce3a1dbb61816e",
      "translationZh": "指令：注入到智能体上下文中的特定领域指导和约束条件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df6ecd44ecf73a4e",
      "translationZh": "工具绑定：技能所依赖的 API、模型上下文协议 (MCP) 服务器或本地命令。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d66370e90fc85e77",
      "translationZh": "知识：参考资料和已完成的示例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec2df324736cd68d",
      "translationZh": "工作流：技能遵循的多步骤流程或决策逻辑。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7d99afa2abc7777",
      "translationZh": "护栏：格式要求、范围限制和验证规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d48275b5aa310c",
      "translationZh": "这种模块化方法有助于团队更快地使智能体专业化，在不同智能体和工作流之间重用经过验证的流程，保持行为一致，并且无需微调底层模型或重写智能体的核心逻辑即可更新特定领域的指导。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87d9f1787051d130",
      "translationZh": "这些失败需要不同的修复方法。不恰当的选择通常指向重叠或模糊的技能描述。指令遵循不完整可能需要更清晰的步骤、不同的技能结构或能力更强的智能体模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8215c55189b0de5",
      "translationZh": "技能选择准确度",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c7c6488768e6226",
      "translationZh": "Strands 评估与 AgentCore 评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b74a44bad2267be7",
      "translationZh": "针对每个被调用的技能进行二元评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "359af7360e8ff52a",
      "translationZh": "调用此技能对于该任务是否恰当？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "498c1f5f854858c9",
      "translationZh": "技能指令遵循能力",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7060a9efa4e63ae",
      "translationZh": "针对每个被调用的技能分为五个等级",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6db0164212100ad",
      "translationZh": "智能体在多大程度上完整地遵循了该技能规定的步骤？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "999021cb9b692ccd",
      "translationZh": "此命名技能是否成功加载？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53d7bd2de448a8d8",
      "translationZh": "由于基于评判器（judge-based）的评估器返回的是每次调用技能的结果，因此多技能运行仍然是可诊断的：您可以识别出是哪个选择或指令遵循结果降低了总分。如果没有调用技能，基于评判器的评估器则不会产生评分。当回归测试具有已知的路由需求时，请将其与 SkillInvoked 配合使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdf4eacb50d56b97",
      "translationZh": "一个具有 Amazon Bedrock 访问权限的 AWS 账户，以及具有对评判模型 InvokeModel 权限的凭据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cedb268782abece",
      "translationZh": "要遵循 Strands Evals 部分，请安装 SDK：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b137acaac61fe1c9",
      "translationZh": "您还需要一段记录好的智能体运行过程。技能评估器接受 Strands Evals Session 或原始消息列表作为轨迹（trajectory）。在启动时，技能提取会识别来自 Strands AgentSkills 插件、Claude Code、Claude Agent SDK、OpenAI Agents SDK、Codex、Gemini CLI、OpenHands、Google ADK 以及通用 SKILL.md 文件读取的信号。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "259aedcb017c0448",
      "translationZh": "要遵循 AgentCore Evaluations 部分，您需要：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c6b7588133dcdef",
      "translationZh": "一个托管在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时或其他地方的智能体。我们将以您可以在自己的账户中部署的 HR 助手智能体为例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec0ddee00e51d392",
      "translationZh": "为该智能体启用可观测性，以便其向 Amazon CloudWatch 发送遥测数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48974787e263549f",
      "translationZh": "CloudWatch 中已启用事务搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bef8c88ea4819cc8",
      "translationZh": "本文中的示例使用了 AgentCore CLI：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4991c68cfe1546ad",
      "translationZh": "使用 Strands Evals 评估记录的轨迹",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bea872f610c3bf5e",
      "translationZh": "当您可以控制测试用例并在开发或持续集成期间重新运行智能体时，Strands Evals 非常有用。请在完整代码示例中查看为 HR 助手智能体创建的完整 Strands evals 代码样本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb28fceee0a9ec7c",
      "translationZh": "1. 定义案例和评估器",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89bc202cc96fa833",
      "translationZh": "2. 运行智能体并捕获其轨迹",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "251acc4e850eba4f",
      "translationZh": "技能评估器会读取运行的轨迹。TracedHandler 收集智能体的 spans 并将其作为轨迹附加：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9629caf2e78d3038",
      "translationZh": "3. 解读报告",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a20f5719f3eda7dc",
      "translationZh": "假设智能体加载了 pdf-table-extraction，运行了 pdftotext -layout，但从未打开提取的文件或定位表格边界。一个简化的报告如下：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d73673e6be43239d",
      "translationZh": "技能指令遵循（Skill Instruction Following）使用五种评分：完全遵循 (1.0)、基本遵循 (0.75)、部分遵循 (0.5)、极少遵循 (0.25) 和未遵循 (0.0)。在达到“基本遵循”或更高水平时即视为通过。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c07ee0229164e0ba",
      "translationZh": "将检查转化为部署门禁",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eac82426a1d7830c",
      "translationZh": "为特定的回归测试用例必须调用的每个关键技能添加 SkillInvoked。因为它不调用模型，所以它是一种快速的路由断言。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69bb154f067b2b1b",
      "translationZh": "根据 report.test_passes 对构建进行门禁控制：if not all(report.test_passes): raise SystemExit(1) .",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05861cc54063adb4",
      "translationZh": "使用聚合分数来跟踪更广泛的趋势，但在强制执行之前，先针对您自己的案例校准阈值。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "30ed4ea731c6660e",
      "translationZh": "使用 AgentCore Evaluations 评估生产环境追踪",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49742557ca9aa80f",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Evaluations 直接与现有的 OpenTelemetry 追踪配合工作，支持按需评估、存储会话的批处理以及实时流量的连续采样。遥测数据被组织成会话（sessions）、追踪（traces）和跨度（spans）。由于技能评估器在工具调用级别运行，因此每个结果都包含一个 spanContext，其中包含识别出的技能调用的 sessionId、traceId 和 spanId。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d346be16c2dfbd6",
      "translationZh": "技能调用可以通过 SKILL.md 文件系统读取（适用于各种框架）或通过 Strands Agents、LangGraph Deep Agents、Google ADK 或 Claude Agent SDK 中的原生技能加载工具来识别。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c8c7a8f028d6a0d5",
      "translationZh": "用于自定义评估器的追踪占位符",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1062d7e92f963eb",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Evaluations 包含两个内置的基于裁判的技能评估器。若要为内置功能未涵盖的内容进行评分，请在 TOOL_CALL 级别创建自定义评估器。工具级模板可以引用技能占位符：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f32dd9abcfb1f11",
      "translationZh": "在此工具调用上加载的技能名称",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88bf000c35de8b41",
      "translationZh": "加载的 SKILL.md 正文",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62bfd85d692045ea",
      "translationZh": "运行时提供的目录，或“(未被此测试框架记录)”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "263ad6bbc9be96b0",
      "translationZh": "触发调用的请求",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c05f97ff397777d",
      "translationZh": "例如，一个检查技能运行中特定属性的模板：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "General-purpose agents",
      "briefZh": "通用型智能体",
      "explanationZh": "指能够处理多种不同类型任务而非仅限于单一任务的AI代理。"
    },
    {
      "term": "system prompt",
      "briefZh": "系统提示词",
      "explanationZh": "用于设定AI模型行为、角色和规则的基础指令。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Tool bindings",
      "briefZh": "工具绑定",
      "explanationZh": "将特定的API、函数或命令与智能体能力进行关联的过程。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Model Context Protocol (MCP)",
